# OSCAL goldens

Any change that writes OSCAL must add or update a golden-file test
(expected catalog or control JSON under `tests/goldens/`) **and** stay
valid against NIST's OSCAL 1.1.2 catalog schema
(`scripts/validate_oscal.mjs`, CI job `oscal-schema`).

The golden is an independent expected value (see `.cursor/skills/tdd/`).
Do not generate it from the function under test in the same run and then
assert equality.

Hold classification and drafting changes to `tests/test_acme.py`.
